00:00:04.261 --> 00:00:05.261
All right, we're live.

00:00:05.661 --> 00:00:07.441
Good evening, everyone.

00:00:07.441 --> 00:00:08.441
Are we live now?

00:00:08.502 --> 00:00:09.802
Can you all see us?

00:00:10.642 --> 00:00:11.482
Yep.

00:00:11.482 --> 00:00:15.243
So, for DMM TV's original show,
The Great Escape...

00:00:16.163 --> 00:00:20.024
we're about to start a watch party
for episode one.

00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:21.784
Yay!

00:00:22.884 --> 00:00:25.645
So, joining us is Yasuda Dai Circus's
Kuro-chan, and...

00:00:26.005 --> 00:00:27.005
I'm Richi.

00:00:27.145 --> 00:00:28.145
Yep.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:30.306
She's my girlfriend.

00:00:30.386 --> 00:00:31.386
To properly introduce her.

00:00:31.386 --> 00:00:32.386
Properly.

00:00:32.706 --> 00:00:33.706
Yep, we're on.

00:00:33.806 --> 00:00:34.887
Thanks for joining us, everyone.

00:00:34.887 --> 00:00:35.887
Thanks.

00:00:36.487 --> 00:00:40.728
So anyway, for this watch party,
we're about to watch...

00:00:42.088 --> 00:00:44.928
The Great Escape, made by Kentaro Fujii
on DMM TV. Oh, it's up there.

00:00:44.928 --> 00:00:45.928
You're right, we can see it.

00:00:46.149 --> 00:00:50.049
It's started, but we still
haven't watched it yet.

00:00:50.269 --> 00:00:51.530
Yeah, we haven't seen
even episode one yet.

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:53.330
I'm curious.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:56.551
Have you heard much about it, though?
Like people talking about it?

00:00:57.411 --> 00:01:01.852
They did that pop-up event
in front of 109, right?

00:01:01.852 --> 00:01:03.052
Yeah, where they took you there
blindfolded.

00:01:03.052 --> 00:01:06.992
And those visuals where only your face
was sticking out of the ground.

00:01:07.093 --> 00:01:07.673
Yeah.

00:01:07.673 --> 00:01:08.673
It was wild.

00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:10.533
There was a huge ad for it in Shibuya too.

00:01:10.953 --> 00:01:12.033
Right, the one with the blindfold?

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:12.754
Yeah.

00:01:12.754 --> 00:01:19.415
Yeah, even though I was blindfolded there,

00:01:19.575 --> 00:01:21.615
we shot a bunch of versions in the studio
to get the blindfold size right.

00:01:21.895 --> 00:01:22.715
Wow.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.656
I had no idea what any of it meant.

00:01:24.656 --> 00:01:25.656
Wow.

00:01:26.616 --> 00:01:28.756
Thanks for watching, everyone.

00:01:30.037 --> 00:01:33.217
So anyway, from here on out,

00:01:34.197 --> 00:01:35.998
I hope we can all have fun watching it
together.

00:01:37.238 --> 00:01:40.538
Richi, remember, Kuro-chan isn't
the only one in The Great Escape.

00:01:40.578 --> 00:01:42.619
True. There were lots of comedians in it.

00:01:42.679 --> 00:01:43.679
Yeah.

00:01:44.439 --> 00:01:48.860
Whether they actually got out or not,

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:52.340
I hope we can enjoy episode one
with all of you.

00:01:53.201 --> 00:01:54.201
Yeah.

00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:57.281
Honestly, what do you think happened
on The Great Escape?

00:01:57.381 --> 00:02:02.062
I mean, all I saw was heads
sticking out of the dirt.

00:02:02.062 --> 00:02:02.822
Right, right.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:07.063
How do you get out from there?
And it's called The Great Escape.

00:02:07.303 --> 00:02:08.303
So you've gotta escape, right?

00:02:08.303 --> 00:02:09.123
Yeah.

00:02:09.123 --> 00:02:13.064
Do they give you hints or anything?
Like stuff to help you escape?

00:02:13.074 --> 00:02:14.074
Oh, like hints?

00:02:14.074 --> 00:02:15.064
Yeah, or tools.

00:02:15.064 --> 00:02:16.004
Yeah.

00:02:16.004 --> 00:02:16.504
Well...

00:02:16.504 --> 00:02:17.504
I really can't imagine it at all.

00:02:17.845 --> 00:02:19.645
They really don't tell you anything.

00:02:19.645 --> 00:02:20.645
Wow.

00:02:21.266 --> 00:02:28.967
Right. You have to try things out
yourself and think,

00:02:29.047 --> 00:02:30.727
"Wait, maybe I can use this somehow," and
figure it out on the spot.

00:02:30.727 --> 00:02:31.387
Wow.

00:02:31.387 --> 00:02:32.107
Right there?

00:02:32.107 --> 00:02:33.107
Right there?

00:02:33.347 --> 00:02:35.508
Yeah, right there, buried in place
without being able to move an inch.

00:02:35.848 --> 00:02:36.548
Wow.

00:02:36.548 --> 00:02:40.588
So I think you'll really see
all the conflict and suffering.

00:02:41.249 --> 00:02:42.429
You've only got your eyes
for information.

00:02:43.069 --> 00:02:44.469
Yeah, your eyes and ears. Well, mostly.

00:02:44.469 --> 00:02:45.129
Oh right, your ears too.

00:02:45.129 --> 00:02:47.530
Yeah. But really, it's just the top
of your face sticking out.

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:53.251
Seriously, I kept thinking, what if some
weirdo or some animal came and ate me?

00:02:53.251 --> 00:02:54.251
Ugh, scary.

00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:58.551
Yeah, because when they buried me...

00:02:59.692 --> 00:03:03.412
it was about a week after
I started dating Richi.

00:03:03.452 --> 00:03:04.452
Right, right.

00:03:04.944 --> 00:03:12.094
So for the first time I was grateful
to Wednesday Downtown and Fujii-san

00:03:14.165 --> 00:03:22.435
for bringing Richi into my life, and then
next thing I know, I'm buried in dirt. I thought I was done for.

00:03:23.056 --> 00:03:25.796
Wow. We were texting every day,
and then all of a sudden...

00:03:25.796 --> 00:03:27.938
Yeah, suddenly all contact stopped
back then.

00:03:28.138 --> 00:03:32.723
I seriously thought it might be
cut off forever.

00:03:32.723 --> 00:03:33.723
Ugh, scary.

00:03:34.264 --> 00:03:40.851
They've put me through all kinds of
awful, scary things, but this was...

00:03:42.692 --> 00:03:44.393
the worst mentally and physically.

00:03:44.493 --> 00:03:45.493
Brutal.

00:03:47.073 --> 00:03:48.033
The worst.
Terrifying.

00:03:48.033 --> 00:03:50.634
Is there anything they've done to you

00:03:50.754 --> 00:03:52.614
that you really hated?
Something that felt especially awful?

00:03:53.414 --> 00:03:54.635
Huh... maybe not yet.

00:03:55.055 --> 00:03:56.055
Not yet?

00:03:56.415 --> 00:03:59.896
Then now that you're dating me,
I'll make you even happier from here on.

00:03:59.896 --> 00:04:00.896
Whoa, whoa.

00:04:01.016 --> 00:04:02.236
Now I kinda want to kiss you.

00:04:02.236 --> 00:04:02.876
No thanks.

00:04:02.876 --> 00:04:03.876
See what I mean?

00:04:05.457 --> 00:04:08.178
All right, we're about to watch it now.
You ready, everyone?

00:04:08.318 --> 00:04:10.978
Ready to have fun with us?
All set?

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:16.799
Okay, then.
Please enjoy episode one with us.

00:04:16.799 --> 00:04:17.799
Here we go.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.020
Oh, it started.

00:04:22.961 --> 00:04:24.841
That opening felt like some generic
"undisclosed Tokyo location" shot.

00:04:24.901 --> 00:04:25.921
Cute.

00:04:26.312 --> 00:04:27.312
Whoa, wow, wow.

00:04:27.312 --> 00:04:28.122
Help!

00:04:28.122 --> 00:04:29.142
What is this? Like a forest?

00:04:30.222 --> 00:04:31.002
Whoa, whoa.

00:04:31.002 --> 00:04:32.002
A mountain.

00:04:32.002 --> 00:04:33.002
This is insane.

00:04:33.903 --> 00:04:34.903
Huh?

00:04:35.604 --> 00:04:36.764
Wait, this is real?

00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:39.025
There was stuff all around him too.

00:04:40.665 --> 00:04:41.665
Brutal.

00:04:42.146 --> 00:04:44.666
He can't move at all.

00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:45.666
Kuro-chan, this is...

00:04:45.666 --> 00:04:46.647
Sand. Sand.

00:04:46.647 --> 00:04:48.907
Man, it's freezing.

00:04:49.468 --> 00:04:50.468
So it was cold.

00:04:50.748 --> 00:04:52.168
That was around November, wasn't it?

00:04:52.568 --> 00:04:53.568
And on top of that...

00:04:55.769 --> 00:05:00.070
I think it rained the day before too.

00:05:00.911 --> 00:05:02.411
Brutal.

00:05:02.851 --> 00:05:03.851
So if it rains, then...

00:05:04.512 --> 00:05:06.132
it gets rock solid.

00:05:06.132 --> 00:05:07.132
I can't get out. Seriously.

00:05:07.462 --> 00:05:08.462
I seriously can't get out.

00:05:08.853 --> 00:05:10.333
What am I supposed to do here?

00:05:10.333 --> 00:05:12.154
If nobody comes, I'm gonna die.

00:05:12.474 --> 00:05:13.354
Wait, what?

00:05:13.354 --> 00:05:14.374
Whoa.

00:05:14.834 --> 00:05:15.334
Whoa.

00:05:15.334 --> 00:05:16.695
Whoa, what's this?

00:05:16.995 --> 00:05:18.015
Oh, it changed.

00:05:19.355 --> 00:05:20.355
It's white.

00:05:23.898 --> 00:05:26.862
So we're following a bunch of comedians
at the same time.

00:05:27.723 --> 00:05:28.664
How about this?

00:05:28.664 --> 00:05:29.664
Huh? What?

00:05:29.765 --> 00:05:30.765
Can I take this off?

00:05:32.468 --> 00:05:34.611
Excuse me, can I take this off now?
Is it about time?

00:05:36.413 --> 00:05:37.033
I'm taking it off.

00:05:37.033 --> 00:05:37.994
What's this?

00:05:37.994 --> 00:05:40.737
True, nobody told them
when to take them off.

00:05:41.558 --> 00:05:43.060
Ready...

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:44.060
Go.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:45.500
What?!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.081
What's going on?

00:05:46.081 --> 00:05:47.962
There's somebody there!

00:05:48.302 --> 00:05:49.463
There's somebody there!
Who is it? What?

00:05:49.463 --> 00:05:50.183
What?

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:52.884
Can I take it off?

00:05:53.544 --> 00:05:54.544
What?

00:05:55.425 --> 00:05:57.126
I'm taking it off for now.

00:05:57.226 --> 00:05:57.726
What?

00:05:57.726 --> 00:05:59.327
Scary! Stop it!
It's back on!

00:05:59.327 --> 00:05:59.987
Take it off! Take it off!

00:05:59.987 --> 00:06:00.987
Who the hell is it? Seriously!

00:06:02.408 --> 00:06:04.109
What the hell is this?

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:06.270
Takano.

00:06:06.531 --> 00:06:07.531
Takano-san.

00:06:07.932 --> 00:06:08.932
Takano.

00:06:09.032 --> 00:06:10.093
What is this, seriously?

00:06:10.093 --> 00:06:11.774
What? Also, we're getting lots of
comments. - We are.

00:06:11.774 --> 00:06:12.334
What, what, what, what?

00:06:12.334 --> 00:06:14.095
I seriously have no idea.
No idea at all.

00:06:14.305 --> 00:06:15.305
Let's watch it along with everybody.

00:06:15.476 --> 00:06:16.476
Yeah.

00:06:16.797 --> 00:06:18.097
What the hell is this? Seriously.

00:06:18.378 --> 00:06:19.378
There's nothing there.

00:06:20.079 --> 00:06:21.079
Huh?

00:06:21.279 --> 00:06:22.160
It's pure white.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.160
It is.

00:06:24.581 --> 00:06:25.581
Huh.

00:06:26.903 --> 00:06:28.964
Another room now.

00:06:30.785 --> 00:06:32.246
Tom Brown.

00:06:32.246 --> 00:06:33.246
What is this?

00:06:34.347 --> 00:06:35.067
Huh.

00:06:35.067 --> 00:06:36.508
Huh.

00:06:37.689 --> 00:06:38.689
There's so much stuff around them.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.210
Cute.

00:06:40.271 --> 00:06:40.791
Candy.

00:06:40.791 --> 00:06:41.791
Huh.

00:06:43.773 --> 00:06:44.773
What?

00:06:45.134 --> 00:06:46.134
Whoa, what's this?

00:06:46.134 --> 00:06:47.134
Huh?

00:06:47.554 --> 00:06:48.554
Candy?

00:06:48.655 --> 00:06:49.655
How is it?

00:06:50.546 --> 00:06:51.546
They're handcuffed together.

00:06:51.816 --> 00:06:54.197
Compared to the trailer,
the room looks pretty cramped.

00:06:54.197 --> 00:06:54.818
Chocolate.

00:06:54.818 --> 00:06:55.818
Oh.

00:06:55.818 --> 00:06:56.818
I thought it'd be bigger.

00:06:57.199 --> 00:06:58.339
Yeah, now that you mention it.

00:06:58.860 --> 00:06:59.940
They've got rice crackers too.

00:07:00.981 --> 00:07:01.561
They look good.

00:07:01.561 --> 00:07:05.583
Oh, but I'm dieting,
so I can't eat them.

00:07:05.783 --> 00:07:08.804
You'd eat them anyway.

00:07:08.804 --> 00:07:09.545
That heart one.

00:07:09.545 --> 00:07:12.346
The Richi-and-Oreo heart.

00:07:12.346 --> 00:07:13.166
The cookie.
Yeah.

00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:14.166
You have to laugh, right?

00:07:14.627 --> 00:07:18.829
Oh, by the way, when that cookie broke in
Monster Love, it wasn't me. It was Miku.

00:07:19.529 --> 00:07:20.529
The worst.

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:22.430
No, it was you.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:23.251
Why?

00:07:23.251 --> 00:07:24.251
Wait, it changed.

00:07:24.792 --> 00:07:25.792
It changed again.

00:07:25.792 --> 00:07:26.792
It did.

00:07:26.973 --> 00:07:27.973
What kind of room is this?

00:07:28.813 --> 00:07:31.655
Also, it annoys me that Shinichi's
holding that thing.

00:07:31.915 --> 00:07:32.755
The trophy.

00:07:32.755 --> 00:07:33.696
That trophy. Every time I see it.

00:07:33.696 --> 00:07:34.696
Oh, that startled me.

00:07:35.616 --> 00:07:36.197
Shinichi.

00:07:36.197 --> 00:07:39.619
What's this?

00:07:39.979 --> 00:07:42.441
Whoa, what is this?

00:07:42.441 --> 00:07:43.441
Whoa.

00:07:44.282 --> 00:07:45.282
Whoa.

00:07:45.523 --> 00:07:47.184
There sure are a lot of bald guys
on this show.

00:07:47.244 --> 00:07:49.005
I'm not bald.
My follicles are just dead.

00:07:49.265 --> 00:07:50.265
There are a lot of bald guys, though.

00:07:50.417 --> 00:07:51.775
No, I'm not.
I've just got a super short cut.

00:07:52.327 --> 00:07:53.287
The rest of those guys are bald, though.

00:07:53.287 --> 00:07:54.287
Bald-guy casting.

00:07:54.508 --> 00:07:56.509
It's not bald-guy casting.

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:57.850
I guess Fujii-san really loves them.

00:07:58.311 --> 00:07:59.271
No, no, no.

00:07:59.271 --> 00:08:00.172
People without much hair.

00:08:00.172 --> 00:08:01.933
It's not like they rounded up
a bunch of thinning guys.

00:08:03.874 --> 00:08:05.475
Oh, something's written there now.

00:08:05.475 --> 00:08:06.296
Ah, I'm freezing.

00:08:06.296 --> 00:08:07.676
You're really watching that closely.

00:08:07.917 --> 00:08:09.598
It's so cold. God.

00:08:10.318 --> 00:08:11.399
And I haven't even eaten anything.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.580
Wait a second.

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:14.441
Shut up, will you?

00:08:14.441 --> 00:08:16.501
Hey, aren't you the guy
who ruins the mood?

00:08:16.581 --> 00:08:17.521
Right?

00:08:17.521 --> 00:08:18.521
What is this?

00:08:18.642 --> 00:08:20.422
What is this?
What?

00:08:20.422 --> 00:08:21.282
It looks like some kind of puzzle.

00:08:21.282 --> 00:08:23.663
Whoa, I'd seriously be hopeless here.

00:08:24.103 --> 00:08:25.383
Mitate, Mitate...

00:08:26.523 --> 00:08:30.364
Mitate is the only wanted guy
I even know.

00:08:30.364 --> 00:08:31.325
Wow.
Ten of them?

00:08:31.325 --> 00:08:32.525
Why Mitate, though?

00:08:32.645 --> 00:08:34.185
Ooh.

00:08:34.805 --> 00:08:37.966
Oh, so they're all trapped
in their own ways.

00:08:38.266 --> 00:08:38.926
Yeah.

00:08:38.926 --> 00:08:39.887
Huh.

00:08:39.887 --> 00:08:43.547
I mean, the others all have rooms

00:08:44.248 --> 00:08:46.088
with things they have to clear or solve,

00:08:46.548 --> 00:08:48.729
but didn't Kuro-chan just get buried
in a completely impossible place?

00:08:48.729 --> 00:08:49.289
True.

00:08:49.289 --> 00:08:50.789
Exactly. Normally it's an impossible game.

00:08:50.969 --> 00:08:51.969
Because it's all hardened around him.

00:08:51.969 --> 00:08:52.550
Yeah.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:56.611
The fact that it was cold out there.

00:08:57.131 --> 00:08:57.811
True.

00:08:57.811 --> 00:08:58.951
It looks warm.
I never knew that.

00:08:58.951 --> 00:09:00.992
That getting buried is actually cold.

00:09:00.992 --> 00:09:01.552
True.

00:09:01.552 --> 00:09:02.732
Even though it looks warm.

00:09:02.732 --> 00:09:03.852
In reality it's chilly.

00:09:04.372 --> 00:09:05.993
It was freezing. Seriously.

00:09:06.253 --> 00:09:07.473
Ha, so it was cold.

00:09:08.373 --> 00:09:09.894
You've got the ground,
and it had been raining too.

00:09:09.894 --> 00:09:12.234
The cold really makes it feel real.

00:09:12.814 --> 00:09:13.814
That's interesting.

00:09:14.435 --> 00:09:17.956
Still, Kuro-chan being buried
doesn't feel that weird somehow.

00:09:17.956 --> 00:09:18.756
Why not?

00:09:18.756 --> 00:09:19.756
Don't make fun of me.

00:09:21.336 --> 00:09:22.236
Oh, wow.

00:09:22.236 --> 00:09:23.456
The colors change a lot.

00:09:23.456 --> 00:09:24.456
It looks cool, though.

00:09:24.797 --> 00:09:27.737
Yeah, they must've obsessed over this.
Fujii-san loves stuff like this.

00:09:27.737 --> 00:09:28.877
So cool.
Whoa.

00:09:28.897 --> 00:09:31.197
Huh.

00:09:32.878 --> 00:09:39.398
Still, Bakarhythm and Kotoge
have it easy, watching from up there.

00:09:40.639 --> 00:09:41.259
True.

00:09:41.259 --> 00:09:45.499
What's this? A dump?
A garbage dump?

00:09:45.639 --> 00:09:47.099
What is this?
An illegal mountain dump site?

00:09:48.119 --> 00:09:49.260
Huh? What is this?

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.220
This is Wednesday, right?

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:55.800
This is a TV show, right?

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.241
Kuro-chan's all about Wednesday.

00:09:57.241 --> 00:09:58.841
Yeah, true.
It does feel very Wednesday.

00:09:58.861 --> 00:09:59.901
He loves Wednesday.

00:10:00.761 --> 00:10:01.761
Is anyone there?

00:10:03.391 --> 00:10:04.391
I'm buried here.

00:10:05.462 --> 00:10:06.462
There's a man buried here.

00:10:07.262 --> 00:10:08.262
There's nobody around.

00:10:08.262 --> 00:10:08.822
What is this?

00:10:08.822 --> 00:10:09.822
Nobody's here.

00:10:10.222 --> 00:10:11.582
I can't see behind me.

00:10:11.682 --> 00:10:14.323
There's something behind me,
but I can't see back there.

00:10:14.963 --> 00:10:15.963
Jeez.

00:10:16.823 --> 00:10:17.523
Whoa.

00:10:17.523 --> 00:10:19.363
Something like this probably happened
somewhere before.

00:10:19.783 --> 00:10:22.264
I bet it did.

00:10:22.264 --> 00:10:23.264
What?

