00:47:34.115 --> 00:47:35.115
That feels right.

00:47:35.435 --> 00:47:38.516
I see. So there are a lot of different
ways to approach it.

00:47:39.096 --> 00:47:43.677
I see. I see. The comments are saying,
"Quit flirting."

00:47:43.677 --> 00:47:44.677
No, no, that is not it.

00:47:45.217 --> 00:47:46.817
Does this really look like flirting to
you?

00:47:47.758 --> 00:47:48.918
We are always like this, though.

00:47:51.118 --> 00:47:52.378
Huh.
Well then.

00:47:52.378 --> 00:47:53.378
Yeah.

00:47:55.219 --> 00:47:58.339
Mina-chan really is amazing. She is
actually highly educated.

00:47:58.439 --> 00:48:00.720
I do not think most people realize
Mina-chan is highly educated.

00:48:01.360 --> 00:48:03.760
Right, because when she talks she seems
kind of airheaded.

00:48:03.760 --> 00:48:04.760
Right, right, right, right.

00:48:04.760 --> 00:48:05.760
Surprisingly.

00:48:06.241 --> 00:48:07.101
Right.

00:48:07.101 --> 00:48:09.172
Oh, the comments are asking, "Who broke
the cookie?"

00:48:09.641 --> 00:48:11.702
Um, the one who broke the cookie was Miku.

00:48:11.982 --> 00:48:12.982
No, that is wrong.

00:48:13.762 --> 00:48:14.562
It was you.

00:48:14.562 --> 00:48:17.763
Why? You did not even see the part where I
broke it.

00:48:17.983 --> 00:48:18.783
True.

00:48:18.783 --> 00:48:19.783
Yeah.

00:48:20.383 --> 00:48:26.844
But honestly, when I saw that speaker...

00:48:28.244 --> 00:48:31.125
I thought, whatever it is, it has to
matter somehow.

00:48:32.785 --> 00:48:34.185
So you knew right away it was a speaker?

00:48:34.405 --> 00:48:35.405
No, I had no idea.

00:48:35.436 --> 00:48:36.436
I was just wondering what it was.

00:48:36.846 --> 00:48:40.806
I did not know, but I thought if I pressed
it, maybe I would hear a voice.

00:48:41.466 --> 00:48:44.847
Huh. I want to know how far along he
actually got from that.

00:48:45.707 --> 00:48:48.328
From what we saw today, how far along did
it feel?

00:48:49.068 --> 00:48:50.488
Hard to say.

00:48:50.668 --> 00:48:51.788
Talking to the speaker...

00:48:51.828 --> 00:48:56.069
Honestly, probably only two or three hours
in.

00:48:56.169 --> 00:48:58.329
But it took me quite a while to notice it.

00:48:58.789 --> 00:48:59.789
Yikes.

00:49:00.770 --> 00:49:05.791
By the way, we have talked through a lot
now, but episode one is over. What do you think happens after this?

00:49:06.211 --> 00:49:07.211
What happens?

00:49:07.671 --> 00:49:11.131
Well, from here, some teams are going to
escape, right?

00:49:11.582 --> 00:49:12.582
Well, who knows?

00:49:12.652 --> 00:49:13.652
Wait, could some of them fail?

00:49:13.652 --> 00:49:16.572
Maybe some people will even have to
retire. We do not know yet.

00:49:16.752 --> 00:49:18.212
Retire?
So that can happen too?

00:49:18.212 --> 00:49:18.873
Yeah.

00:49:18.873 --> 00:49:20.573
No idea. I really do not know.

00:49:20.673 --> 00:49:24.894
Yikes. What is going to happen? Now I
really want to know.

00:49:24.974 --> 00:49:25.774
Right.

00:49:25.774 --> 00:49:28.514
It has you curious like this, and I think
everyone watching is curious too.

00:49:29.114 --> 00:49:31.135
DMM TV original series, The Great Escape,

00:49:31.375 --> 00:49:34.775
thank you all for watching the episode-one
watch party.

00:49:34.775 --> 00:49:36.016
I want to watch episode two.
Thank you very much.

00:49:36.036 --> 00:49:38.416
All right, Richi, give us a little more of
your thoughts after watching episode one.

00:49:38.496 --> 00:49:40.516
You already asked that a second ago. Yeah.
You really keep asking it.

00:49:40.616 --> 00:49:41.616
Yeah.

00:49:41.857 --> 00:49:42.777
Well, we might as well.

00:49:42.777 --> 00:49:48.178
But it is true, there were all kinds of
rooms, and the way out and the hints were different for each.

00:49:48.218 --> 00:49:51.958
Right, right. And the clues were different
too. Wow, now I really want to know.

00:49:52.918 --> 00:49:55.699
You are curious, right? I want to watch
episode two as soon as possible, right now.

00:49:55.819 --> 00:50:02.740
Exactly. So then, starting at midnight
tonight, which is less than ten minutes away now...

00:50:02.740 --> 00:50:03.400
Yeah.

00:50:03.400 --> 00:50:08.121
episodes three and four of The Great
Escape will be released on DMM TV.

00:50:08.321 --> 00:50:09.721
Right after this.
Yes, and then...

00:50:09.961 --> 00:50:10.652
Yeah.

00:50:10.652 --> 00:50:17.943
There is more. Episode one will also be
available for free on this YouTube channel. Yay!

00:50:18.073 --> 00:50:19.073
So we can watch it again?

00:50:19.243 --> 00:50:21.503
Exactly, you can rewatch it. So if there
was some part you were curious about...

00:50:21.503 --> 00:50:22.043
True.

00:50:22.043 --> 00:50:23.524
or some part that made you want to watch
it again...

00:50:23.524 --> 00:50:24.244
True.

00:50:24.244 --> 00:50:29.184
then you can look again at how Kuro-chan
escaped, what was behind him, what all was there...

00:50:29.204 --> 00:50:30.005
I want to see that.

00:50:30.005 --> 00:50:34.685
You can pause and check carefully, so
please watch it, everyone.

00:50:35.346 --> 00:50:38.586
Oh. Well, Richi said she is curious about
episode two, so after this...

00:50:38.586 --> 00:50:40.066
Timing.
Are you going to watch it again?

00:50:40.526 --> 00:50:41.526
Yes.

00:50:43.517 --> 00:50:52.648
And everyone watching too, if you have
seen episodes one and two, then episodes three and four go live at midnight, so please check them out.

00:50:52.648 --> 00:50:53.809
Wow.

00:50:53.809 --> 00:50:54.429
I am excited.

00:50:54.429 --> 00:51:00.070
Right. I do keep seeing comments saying,
"I want to know about episode two," and "Richi's left hand," honestly.

00:51:00.070 --> 00:51:00.830
Yay.

00:51:00.830 --> 00:51:01.830
Wait, my left hand?

00:51:02.710 --> 00:51:03.710
Yeah. Thanks.

00:51:03.710 --> 00:51:06.131
Ah, someone is asking, "Are you going to
