00:51:23.754 --> 00:51:24.334
A whole three months.

00:51:24.334 --> 00:51:30.455
Yes, and if you sign up now, you can watch
for free for three months, so please take this chance to sign up and check it out.

00:51:31.675 --> 00:51:38.496
Thank you very much. So, Richi, even
though I was buried and going through all that...

00:51:38.496 --> 00:51:39.496
Kurosawa-san...

00:51:39.936 --> 00:51:42.037
you did not show even a trace of "poor
thing."

00:51:42.037 --> 00:51:42.757
True.

00:51:42.757 --> 00:51:43.697
That actually surprised me.

00:51:43.697 --> 00:51:45.057
It just looked kind of funny.
You did not feel sorry for him?

00:51:45.628 --> 00:51:46.628
Well, he is fine now.

00:51:46.877 --> 00:51:48.019
Ah, right, because we are watching him
now.

00:51:48.658 --> 00:51:49.278
Yeah.

00:51:49.278 --> 00:51:50.278
I guess that is true.

00:51:50.719 --> 00:51:53.099
Maybe it just gets harsher and harsher as
you watch.

00:51:53.479 --> 00:51:55.020
No, I think it really does get tougher for
me.

00:51:55.660 --> 00:51:56.660
By the way...

00:51:56.860 --> 00:52:01.141
I really was putting out this pitiful,
tragic feeling the whole time, at least in my head.

00:52:01.381 --> 00:52:02.041
Oh, you were?

00:52:02.041 --> 00:52:06.982
I was. More than that, honestly it was
like, "Please help me."

00:52:06.982 --> 00:52:07.902
Yeah.

00:52:07.902 --> 00:52:11.283
And when I was feeling like, "Help me," a
lot of staff members told me...

00:52:12.203 --> 00:52:15.964
even at other times, they would tell me,
"Kuro-chan never looks pitiful."

00:52:16.704 --> 00:52:20.605
They say that is actually a good thing,
but I feel like I am putting it out more than anyone.

00:52:21.585 --> 00:52:25.266
True. So everyone, you might not be able
to watch what comes next without tears, but...

00:52:25.806 --> 00:52:29.687
please watch the rest.

00:52:30.907 --> 00:52:32.588
When you are frustrated, bite your lip.
Tehepero.

00:52:33.328 --> 00:52:34.428
We do not need that.

00:52:34.428 --> 00:52:35.428
Please.

00:52:35.808 --> 00:52:39.909
All right, everyone, thank you for
watching along with us today.

00:52:39.909 --> 00:52:40.909
Thank you very much.

00:52:41.550 --> 00:52:42.550
Okay.

00:52:42.690 --> 00:52:43.690
Watch it, okay?

00:52:43.830 --> 00:52:45.210
The Great Escape.
Watch it, okay?

